Cause: recipe IOWEB_TEST_R003 went 12-Site -> Single Site on 10-04 21:53 (oplog_20261004 editlist.save). ChangeSite's Single Site arm
(golden cinitial.cpp:12187-12191, HT9046 family; HT9050 added 09-25) swaps Index Aa <- Af (FTestSuck 0x41, a station this machine does
not have) and Arm2 Aa <- Bf (0x51, a DI module): the Vacuum Unit page showed Error5 / 999.0 and the flow's Index nozzle pointed there.
cinitial.cpp ChangeSite: the swap is skipped when W906_GpibModel=="9050GPIB" || MachineTypeChoice==Type_HT9050 (this machine decodes as
Type_HT9046_LS, so the GPIB test is needed). Every other machine: golden. Same line.
tests/test_machine_suckers.cpp (2d): SingleSite now expects HT9050 != HT9046_LS; the hand check expects the unswapped names; + the real
machine (Type_HT9046_LS with Model 9050GPIB) keeps FTestSuckAA while plain HT9046_LS still swaps. Those pass; 7 older checks of
MachineSuckers_HT9050 fail against machines/HT9050/IO_Table.csv (outside git: sucker IP 160 -> 162 since 10-02, Enable count) -- not this change.
HT9050_DryRun passed. Release linked; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program). Backup D:\HT9045\_review\cinitial.cpp.bak_suck9050_20261007_191537.
WORKLOG row 178.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
